  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "43b90260",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "the real problem demonstrated by this implementation is that repeated states continue to be generated, and if the goal were unreachable, the search could continue indefinitely.\n",
    "\n",
    "The max_steps parameter is therefore only a safety limit for the demonstration, it is not part of the BFS concept."
   ]
  },
